OL,9,FOne afternoon in April, a
OL,10,F"hyperventilating" children's nursery
OL,11,Fworker approached her manager in a
OL,12,F"hysterical state".
OL,14,FGabrielle Debotte, 27, had "something
OL,15,Fserious" to tell Nicola Goddard,
OL,16,Fadding: "You're going to hate me and
OL,17,FI'm going to lose my job."
